  Latest fully covered cohort:   birth_year <= 2024-17 = 2007

6-17 window (loss data needed: birth+6 to birth+17):
  Earliest fully covered cohort: birth_year >= 1991-6 = 1985
  Latest fully covered cohort:   birth_year <= 2024-17 = 2007

